hree regions, and showed an error rate of about 18%.\n- **Incident:** I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api, which paged the on-call engineer. It describes the v2.3.1 failure, the rollback to v2.3.0, and next steps.\n\nI haven't re-checked the error rate since the rollback, so recovery is not confirmed yet. The incident lists confirming recovery and investigating the v2.3.1 failure as next steps.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01SUywQ2ZHwDQKnv6GBBez6v", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_015uedaVbpihBKGncKaEUb1w", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0. v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production and is running in all three regions. I'll roll back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Lvpn2QLxpyYfJkJKdYdCbi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0", "confidence": 0.93}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_016LSi7TihxXrdyAhzESbCxu", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate ~18%, unhealthy in us-east, us-west, eu-west). Action taken: rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0, the most recent production release with healthy status, in all production regions (